3. THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS & LIBRARIES NOTICE
================================================================================

The Jacktor Audio repository bundles and links against several third-party 
software components. These components are NOT covered by CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 and 
remain subject to their respective original copyright holders and open-source 
licenses:

- Nofrendo NES Emulation Engine (firmware/panel/components/nofrendo):
  Subject to the Nofrendo License / GNU General Public License terms.
- micro_flac Component (firmware/panel/components/micro_flac):
  Subject to the original esphome-libs / FLAC decoder license.
- micro_mp3 Component (firmware/panel/components/micro_mp3):
  Subject to the OpenCore-MP3dec / Apache License 2.0 terms.
- KissFFT Real-to-Complex Transform Engine (include/driver/kissfft):
  Copyright (c) Mark Borgerding. Subject to the 3-Clause BSD License.
- LVGL Graphics Library (managed via idf_component.yml):
  Copyright (c) LVGL LLC. Subject to the MIT License.
- cJSON Library (managed via idf_component.yml):
  Copyright (c) Dave Gamble and cJSON contributors. Subject to the MIT License.

The CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 license applies strictly to the original code, firmware logic, 
DSP signal calibration algorithms, hardware telemetry state machines, display views, 
schematics, scripts, and documentation authored by Ardo Zapp.

